  "title": "Relay Foundry",
  "rules": [
    "Roles 0, 1 and 2 alone cut, weld and calibrate respectively; everyone can carry, assist or ship.",
    "Each worker holds at most one part; the only clamp can travel with a part or separately.",
    "Powered work requires the role at its station, the cool clamp, and another worker assisting from an adjacent cell in the same tick.",
    "The clamp heats to three after welding or calibration; work requires heat zero at the start of the tick.",
    "Only the current serial queue head can ship; stages never reverse and finite parts never respawn.",
    "Entity sight is Manhattan radius three; the map, shipping count and audit counts are public.",
    "Joint reward is -0.002 per step, +0.1 per stage advance and +1 per shipment.",
    "Four shipments finish the episode; otherwise the horizon is 192."
  ],
